WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:06.520
What if your audience didn't just watch the experience, but controlled it?

2
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:13.380
Meet The Magic Mirror, a real-time AI installation that transforms visitors into the centerpiece

3
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.340
of your story.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.280
Designed for brands, exhibitions and live events, it turns passive attention into

5
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:26.420
active participation, driving longer dwell time, deeper interaction and high-impact

6
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.420
shareable moments.

7
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:34.780
One installation supports infinite experiences, from identity transformation and living artworks

8
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.320
to touch-triggered environments, interactive games and responsive visuals.

9
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.320
Every element is built to adapt.

10
00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:47.520
Prompts are tailored to your campaign, visual styles are trained for brand consistency

11
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.800
and the entire experience is managed live through a web app.

12
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:57.280
Whether placed in a retail space or at the heart of a global event, The Magic Mirror

13
00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.620
gives your audience more than something to watch.

14
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.080
It makes them part of it.

15
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.360
Magic Mirror.

16
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.760
One technology, infinite experiences.
